; grain — after Xenakis: stochastic sound with nothing coming in (runs on the SP-1 too).
; fader1 - fader3 are written next to each scene

storm over mycenae
------------------
; GENDY: fader1 how far the heights wander, fader2 how far the lengths (and the
; pitch); a slow random voltage moves its pitch; a dust of particles from it
the storm is gendy 2 dist=cauchy
the drift is smoothrandom 1
the dust is particles 3 dist=cauchy
fader1 -> storm.amp_step
fader2 -> storm.dur_step
drift -50> storm.pitch
storm -> dust
fader3 -> dust.screen
storm -50> out
dust -> left
dust.right -> right

a voice from the radiator pipes
-------------------------------
; FOF trainlets: fader1 the formant, fader2 how wide it rings, fader3 from
; bursts to a steady voice; the pitch walks a little
the pipes is trainlet 2 chroma=40
the walk is steprandom 1
fader1 -> pipes.formant
fader2 -> pipes.bandwidth
fader3 -> pipes.density
walk -30> pipes.pitch
the room is reverb 2
pipes -> room
pipes room -> out
